      "value": "Requirements extracted from Zimmermann Functional Requirements excel, downloaded July 3rd, 2026 after all requirements were confirmed. — source of truth. Req ID prefix: **SPR**.\n\n⚠️ **Rows with strikethrough are out of scope** — struck through in the Excel source file.\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Req ID | Functional Area | Sub-Functional Area | Requirement | Owner | Storefront | Config/Custom | Status | Comments | User Story Link |\n| SPR-01 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system will support dedicated landing page for each category, listing all products in that category in a grid layout | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-01> |\n| SPR-02 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system will support a 'view more' pattern on the product listing page that loads more products. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | @Jasmijn Tsang number of view more is custom build, it’s handled in FE. Dani has suggested 36. Needs confirmation | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-02> |\n| SPR-03 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system will support a collapsible editorial/SEO paragraph with a 'read more' expand. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-03> |\n| SPR-04 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system will support configurable title, description, and hero image per category page | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-04> |\n| SPR-05 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | ~~The system will support a \"Model/Item View\" toggle that switches all tiles between model and item photos; it must be persistent across pagination and filters.~~ | ~~Accenture~~ | ~~ALL~~ | ~~Custom~~ | ~~Confirmed~~ | Striking out this functional requirement on model/item view toggle on PLP - as per new designs - this FR is no longer relevant.  CC: @Dani Rivett | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-05> |\n| SPR-06 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system will display a “No products found” state when all filters result in zero products, with a prompt to clear filters | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-06> |\n| SPR-07 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system will support the ability for business users to preview category and product states before publishing | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-07> |\n| SPR-08 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system will support toggling categories and products online or offline via Business Manager, | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-08> |\n| SPR-09 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system will support scheduling category visibility in advance via Business Manager, allowing a business user to automate when seasonal or campaign categories become visible or hidden on the storefront | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-09> |\n| SPR-10 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system will support showing product image, name, and price for each product tile | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-10> |\n| SPR-11 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system will show each possible colour variant for a product as a separate tile | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-11> |\n| SPR-12 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system will surface markdown pricing on product tiles within the Product Listing Page (PLP), displaying both the original retail price (\"Was...\") and the reduced sale price (\"Now...\") | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-12> |\n| SPR-13 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system will, on hover in desktop, alternate between the model and flat/item image variants stored per product tile. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-13> |\n| SPR-14 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system will display a ~~save-to-wishlist~~ cart icon on each product tile on the PLP | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | Changed FR to cart icon - wishlist on product card in PLP is not part of the new designs  CC: @Dani Rivett | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-14> |\n| SPR-15 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system must prompt the shopper to select a size when they tap the ~~wishlist~~ cart icon on a PLP tile, so that entries are saved at SKU/size level rather than product level | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | Changed FR from wishlist to cart on PLP product tile functionality.    CC: @Dani Rivett | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-15> |\n| SPR-16 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system will support ~~clickable~~ product badges (RUNWAY, CAMPAIGN, etc.) on tiles, driven by configurable product attributes in Business Manager; a product can be assigned multipled badges | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-16> |\n| SPR-17 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system must prompt the shopper to select a size when the customer clicks Quick Add to Bag which enables them to add a product to their cart without navigating to the Product Detail Page (PDP) | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-17> |\n| SPR-18 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system must support business-user-controlled merchandising rules including manual curation, rules-based ordering, and scheduled updates | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-18> |\n| SPR-19 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must support faceted navigation on the PLP driven by product attributes defined in the SFCC catalogue, configurable by business users in Business Manager at global (e.g. colours, size) and category level (e.g. sleeve length for dresses) | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-19> |\n| SPR-20 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system will hide facet values that would return zero results when combined with already-applied filters | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-20> |\n| SPR-21 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system will apply OR logic within a facet (e.g. Red OR Blue) and AND logic across facets (e.g. Colour AND Size) | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-21> |\n| SPR-22 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must support multi-select filtering within a facet group | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-22> |\n| SPR-23 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must support global category filters including colour, size, material, and availability | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-23> |\n| SPR-24 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must support category-specific facets (e.g. sleeve length) configurable per category | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-24> |\n| SPR-25 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must include print and pattern names as values within the Colour facet alongside solid colour values | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-25> |\n| SPR-26 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must support the creation and management of colour swatches in Business Manager, enabling business users to map colour attribute values (Floral, Cream, etc.) to a hex code or swatch image | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed | Assign one primary colour - probably have an attribute to capture multi colours | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-26> |\n| SPR-27 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must support an Availability filter, which supports at minimum the following product states: \"In Stock\" | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-27> |\n| SPR-28 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must display applied filter state as visible labels within the filter panel for multi-choice facets (e.g., Colour, Material, Size), with the ability to remove filters individually or clear all at once | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-28> |\n| SPR-29 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must support sort options on the PLP (e.g. Best Sellers, Price, Newest Arrival); the sort options available to shoppers and the default sort order per category will be configurable by a business user in Business Manager | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-29> |\n| SPR-30 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must support multivariate testing of sorting rules on category pages natively in Business Manager | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-30> |\n| SPR-31 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must automatically demote or suppress out-of-stock products within category and search results, without requiring manual intervention by the merchandising team | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed | Additional Note: option to turn this on in certain categories is needed, on some pages manual preferred (can be configured in BM) | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-31> |\n| SPR-32 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must support explicit product ordering based on a manually assigned rank, configurable by a business user in Business Manager. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-32> |\n| SPR-33 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | ~~Search~~ | ~~How will colour and material grouping be structured in SFCC to support products that span multiple colour groups, and how will swatches be displayed where multiple groups apply? Colour mapping exercise TBC~~ | ~~Accenture~~ | ~~ALL~~ |  |  |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-33> |\n| SPR-34 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system will support real-time keyword search across all product attributes (e.g. name, description, colour, size, material), returning ranked results | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-34> |\n| SPR-35 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system will be able to submit a search and navigate to the results page when the user presses Enter or taps the Search button | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-35> |\n| SPR-36 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system will display ~~\"Search Items\" as the~~ placeholder text in the search input | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-36> |\n| SPR-37 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must provide predictive autocomplete suggestions as customers type, surfacing relevant products, categories, and trending search terms | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-37> |\n| SPR-38 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must display a focused state when the search input is focused with no text, showing: Popular Searches (configured trending terms), category navigation shortcuts, and a product items grid | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-38> |\n| SPR-39 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must render the typed autocomplete as a two-panel layout: left panel showing keyword suggestion; right panel showing product items grid | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-39> |\n| SPR-40 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must include a \"View All\" link within the autocomplete panel, directing to the full search results page | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-40> |\n| SPR-41 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must surface category shortcut links within the autocomplete dropdown, allowing direct navigation to a category page without completing a full search | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-41> |\n| SPR-42 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must support Popular Search terms that can be both manually curated by business users and algorithmically driven with Einstein | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-42> |\n| SPR-43 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must display local currency pricing in search autocomplete results, driven by currency conversion feeds; Global-e handles product prices for all international storefronts | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-43> |\n| SPR-44 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system will apply search dictionary rules to the results query, ensuring that synonyms, related terms, and AI-recommended dictionary entries are reflected in the returned result set. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-44> |\n| SPR-45 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system will display the total result count on the search results page in the format '[X] RESULTS'. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-45> |\n| SPR-46 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system will render a breadcrumb on the search results page as: HOME > SEARCH RESULTS FOR '[QUERY]'. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-46> |\n| SPR-47 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must display the search term the user entered on the zero-results page, so they can confirm what was searched. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-47> |\n| SPR-48 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must display a search input field on the zero-results page so the user can run a new search without navigating away from the page. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-48> |\n| SPR-49 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must display a result count of zero on the zero-results page, clearly communicating that no matches were found. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-49> |\n| SPR-50 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must display a curated product or content module on the zero-results page (e.g. New Arrivals) to provide alternative discovery pathways when no results are found. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-50> |\n| SPR-51 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must display a message on the zero-results page encouraging the user to modify or broaden their search query. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-51> |\n| SPR-52 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must display a set of navigational shortcuts on the zero-results page to key site destinations (e.g. Shipping, Returns, Privacy) to help users continue their journey. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-52> |\n| SPR-53 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system must display an alternative search term on the zero-results page that the user can select to rerun the search, where a likely spelling variant exists. | Accenture | ALL |  | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-53> |\n| SPR-54 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system will support merchandiser-configured search redirects, automatically navigating customers to a designated page when a matching redirect rule is triggered in Business Manager. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-54> |\n| SPR-55 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system will display products in a grid layout on the search results page, with the number of columns adapting responsively across desktop, tablet, and mobile breakpoints. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-55> |\n| SPR-56 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system will display each product tile on the search results page with product image, product name, and price. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-56> |\n| SPR-57 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Search | The system will support ordering and multi-facet filtering of search results; available facets and sort options will be driven by indexed product attributes and configured by a business user via the Search Refinement Definitions in SFCC Business Manager. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-57> |\n| SPR-58 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Recommendations | The system must display a \"You May Also Like\" or equivalent recommendations carousel on the PDP, Cart, slide-out Mini-Bag, and My Account page, powered by SFCC Einstein Product Recommendations | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-58> |\n| SPR-59 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Recommendations | The system must support a mix of AI-driven and rules-gated recommendation logic, with the ability to configure rules by season and category | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-59> |\n| SPR-60 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Recommendations | The system must support a \"Complete the Look\" cross-sell surface on the PDP, Cart, and slide-out Mini-Bag, configurable through Salesforce Commerce Cloud | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-60> |\n| SPR-61 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Recommendations | The system must display \"Recently Viewed\" products on the PDP and Cart page; browsing history to be stored in the browser session and persisted cross-session on login | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-61> |\n| SPR-62 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Recommendations | The system must allow Add to Bag via size variant selection directly from recommendation carousels on the PDP and Cart pages | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed | @Tim Lavelle @Marcel Angelo Navarro - open discussion on whether user should go to product page, and whether this can be toggled on/off (this would require customisation, and be an enhancement) | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-62> |\n| SPR-63 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Recommendations | The system must support AI-driven merchandising using SFCC Einstein, enabling automated product ordering on category pages and search result pages based on behavioural data and performance signals | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed | Additional note: Functionality to be used on sub category pages, not major pages like New Arrivals etc - not sure if feasible @Manikandan Ramachandran (Deactivated) @Victor T. Crisostomo to check | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-63> |\n| SPR-64 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system must support the display of an editorial hero image, including an optional headline and body text, inline within the product grid on category pages, configurable by a business user in Business Manager. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-64> |\n| SPR-65 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system must display a configurable set of inline category links on the product listing page, positioned below the hero image and above the product grid. The links must be contextual, reflecting the subcategories relevant to the current page. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-65> |\n| SPR-66 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | The system must allow business users to define and prioritise which subcategories appear inline per page in Business Manager, with the full category set remaining accessible within the filtering panel alongside standard filters. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-66> |\n| SPR-67 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Product Listing Page | ~~The system must allow business users to insert editorial or video content into PLPs and/or feature certain products on larger tiles within the grid (manually merchandised features).~~ | Accenture | ALL |  | Confirmed | Descoped as requirement written by Zimmermann, will be design dependent | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-67> |\n| SPR-68 | Search, PLP & Recommendations | Filters & Facets | The system must allow business users to create new filters and manually assign products to them when needed (overriding their default data). | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%20%3D%20SPR-68> |",
