      "value": "Requirements extracted from Zimmermann Functional Requirements excel, downloaded July 3rd, 2026 after all requirements were confirmed. — source of truth. Req ID prefix: **REG**.\n\n⚠️ **Rows with strikethrough are out of scope** — struck through in the Excel source file.\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Req ID | Functional Area | Sub-Functional Area | Requirement | Owner | Storefront | Config/Custom | Status | Comments | User Stories |\n| REG-001 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Storefront Configuration | The system will support 7 independent storefronts in SFCC Business Manager (AU, US (Domestic & International), UK, EU Domestic, EU International, HK, ME), each configured as a separate site. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed | Confirmed 8 storefronts | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-001> |\n| REG-002 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Storefront Configuration | The system will assign each storefront its own currency, tax display model, locale set, delivery options, and payment methods, configured independently in SFCC Business Manager. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-002> |\n| REG-003 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Storefront Configuration | The AU storefront will operate on a domestic checkout path (SFCC-owned), serving Australia and NZ/Oceania customers in AUD. | Accenture | AU | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-003> |\n| REG-004 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Storefront Configuration | The UK storefront will operate on a domestic checkout path (SFCC-owned), serving the United Kingdom in GBP. | Accenture | UK | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-004> |\n| REG-005 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Storefront Configuration | The US storefront will support both a domestic checkout path (SFCC-owned) and an international checkout path (Global-e-owned) within the same site; the path is determined by the customer's shipping address | Accenture | US | Custom | Confirmed | 8 storefronts (US International and Domestic separate) | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-005> |\n| REG-006 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Storefront Configuration | The system will process all orders placed on the EU domestic storefront through the SFCC domestic checkout path, serving EU customers in EUR | Accenture | EU dom | Config | Confirmed | The EU Dom site needs to be able to support one RRP, however multiple EU zone VAT requirements in order payload. To confirm if Avalara is going to handle this? | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-006> |\n| REG-006 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Storefront Configuration | The system will process all orders placed on the EU international storefront through a Global-e owned checkout path, with currency determined by the customer's shipping address. The EU domestic and EU international storefronts are separate storefronts | Accenture | EU Int | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-006> |\n| REG-007 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Storefront Configuration | The HK storefront will operate as a Global-e-only checkout storefront; all checkout, payment, and tax handling is managed by Global-e. | Accenture | HK | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-007> |\n| REG-008 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Storefront Configuration | The ME storefront will operate as a Global-e-only checkout storefront; all checkout, payment, and tax handling is managed by Global-e. | Accenture | ME | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-008> |\n| REG-009 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Storefront Configuration | The AU storefront is gated; it is accessible to AU and NZ/Pacific Island IP addresses only. | Accenture | AU | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-009> |\n| REG-010 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Storefront Configuration | The system will allow business users to manage storefront configuration in SFCC Business Manager at both a global level (applying across all storefronts) and at an individual storefront level. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-010> |\n| REG-011 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Storefront Configuration | The system will display locale-specific additional fields at the billing address step where required by market (e.g. Italian fiscal code (Codice Fiscale) or VAT ID for the Italian locale). | Accenture | EU | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-011> |\n| REG-012 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Storefront Configuration | The system will support all required US address formats on the US storefront. The system will not support APO, FPO or PO Box addresses | Accenture | US | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-012> |\n| REG-013 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Storefront Configuration | The system will automatically route customers to the correct regional storefront based on IP geolocation on site entry | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-013> |\n| REG-014 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Country Slide Out | The system will detect a mismatch between the customer's IP-detected country and the current storefront's shipping region on site entry. | Accenture | ALL (excl. AU) | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-014> |\n| REG-015 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Country Slide Out | The system will display a country slide-out when a shipping location mismatch is detected, informing the customer that they appear to be visiting from a different location. This will show only if the customer is accessing a different storefront. The customer can dismiss the selector and continue browsing on their current storefront without making a change | Accenture | ALL (excl. AU) | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-015> |\n| REG-016 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Country Slide Out | The system will present two CTAs within the slide-out: one to redirect the customer to the appropriate storefront for their detected location, and one to open the country selector to manually change their shipping country. | Accenture | ALL (excl. AU) | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-016> |\n| REG-017 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Country Slide Out | The system will display a warning within the slide-out that changing shipping location may remove items from the customer's bag. | Accenture | ALL (excl. AU) | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-017> |\n| REG-018 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Country Slide Out | The system will not display the country slide-out if the customer's detected country matches the current storefront's shipping region. | Accenture | ALL (excl. AU) | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-018> |\n| REG-019 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Country Slide Out | The system will display the country slide-out on first visit only; it will not reappear once the customer has made a selection or dismissed it. | Accenture | ALL (excl. AU) | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-019> |\n| REG-020 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Country Selector | The system will present a country selector allowing customers to manually change their shipping country, redirecting them to the appropriate storefront URL if a selection is made | Accenture | ALL (excl. AU) | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-020> |\n| REG-021 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Country Selector | The country selector will display available countries grouped by region (e.g. Asia/Oceania, Europe, Americas) with their associated currency and a search field. | Accenture | ALL (excl. AU) | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-021> |\n| REG-022 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Country Selector | The system will warn customers that changing their location may result in items being removed from their bag. | Accenture | ALL (excl. AU) | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-022> |\n| REG-023 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Country Selector | Country and language selection will be combined within the same selector. For the EU domestic storefront, customers will be able to select their preferred language (English, French, Italian, Spanish). All other storefronts offer English only. | Accenture | ALL (excl. AU) | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-023> |\n| REG-024 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Country Selector | The selected locale will be reflected in the storefront URL (e.g. /fr-eu/, /it-eu/, /en-eu/). | Accenture | EU | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-024> |\n| REG-025 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Country Selector | All storefronts except AU will include the country selector and allow cross-navigation between regional sites. The AU storefront is gated and does not allow inbound cross-navigation from other sites. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-025> |\n| REG-026 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Country Slide Out | The system will route customers who select China from the country selector to the HK website. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-026> |\n| REG-027 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Country Slide Out | The system will route customers who select Australia from the country selector to the HK website. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-027> |\n| REG-028 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Country Slide Out | The system will lock the shipping country in the Global-e checkout for international orders. The shipping country is determined by the customer's country selector selection prior to checkout entry and cannot be changed within the Global-e checkout flow. To change their shipping country, the customer must return to the storefront and update their country selector selection. | Zimmermann | HK, ME, US, EU |  | Confirmed | Should be de-scoped, this is Global-e requirement | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-028> |\n| REG-029 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Language Modal | The system will display the language mismatch modal on the EU domestic storefront only, when the customer's GEO-IP detected country does not match the language of the storefront URL they have landed on. | Accenture | EU | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-029> |\n| REG-030 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Language Modal | The system will map the following countries to their corresponding EU language locale: France and Monaco to French (/fr-eu/), Italy and San Marino to Italian (/it-eu/), Spain to Spanish (/es-eu/). | Accenture | EU | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-030> |\n| REG-031 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Language Modal | The system will display the modal message in the language of the current storefront URL (not the detected country language), in the format: \"Welcome to Zimmermann Europe — we noticed you're located in [detected country].\" This will not show up if accessing the EU domestic website | Accenture | EU | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-031> |\n| REG-032 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Language Modal | The system will present two CTAs in the modal: one to continue on the current language locale, and one to switch to the locale associated with the detected country. | Accenture | EU | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-032> |\n| REG-033 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Language Modal | The system will not display the modal when the customer's detected country matches the language of the current storefront URL. | Accenture | EU | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-033> |\n| REG-034 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Language Modal | The system will not display the modal for customers detected in countries with no dedicated EU language locale (i.e. all countries outside France, Monaco, Italy, San Marino, Spain), offering English (/en-eu/) as the default alternative. | Accenture | EU | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-034> |\n| REG-035 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Language Modal | The system will apply this logic consistently regardless of entry point, including Instagram, Google Shopping feeds, direct URL entry, and organic search. | Accenture | EU | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-035> |\n| REG-036 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Multi-Currency & Pricing | The system will display product prices in the storefront currency on PDP, PLP, mini-cart, and cart: AUD on AU, USD on US domestic, GBP on UK, and EUR on EU domestic. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-036> |\n| REG-037 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Multi-Currency & Pricing | The system will calculate and display tax for AU (GST), UK (VAT), and EU domestic (VAT) using SFCC native tax tables. Avalara will not be used for these storefronts, with the exception of New Zealand and New Caledonia orders placed on the AU storefront, where Avalara will be used for duty and tax calculation. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-037> |\n| REG-038 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Multi-Currency & Pricing | The system will display prices exclusive of tax for US domestic. Applicable sales tax will be calculated by Avalara and added at checkout. | Accenture | US | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-038> |\n| REG-039 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Multi-Currency & Pricing | The system will support a single currency per domestic storefront. No multi-currency toggle will be available within any domestic storefront. | Accenture | AU, UK, EU, US | Custom | Confirmed | @Jasmijn Tsang - There is no multi currency - add to enhancement log for AU domestic multi-currency i.e. NZD | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-039> |\n| REG-040 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Multi-Currency & Pricing | ~~The system will display pricing, currency, and tax on PDP, mini-cart, and cart for HK, ME, US international, and EU international orders using values sourced via Global-e pricing logic.~~ |  | HK, ME, US, EU |  | ~~Open~~ | Descoped as SFCC handles all price books. Global-e scope | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-040> |\n| REG-041 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Multi-Currency & Pricing | ~~The system will hand off all pricing, currency, tax, and duties to Global-e from checkout onwards for HK, ME, US international, and EU international orders. SFCC will not independently calculate tax or currency for these paths.~~  The system will display product prices from SFCC price books for HK, ME, US international and EU international storefronts. At checkout, the system will hand off to Global-e who will calculate and apply shipping charges, duties and taxes. SFCC will not independently calculate shipping, duties or tax for these checkout paths | Accenture | HK, ME, US, EU | Custom | Confirmed | Descoped as SFCC handles all price books. Global-e scope | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-041> |\n| REG-042 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Multi-Currency & Pricing | The system will display sale pricing in a was/now format. If the price is updated again following a sale, only the current (now) price will be updated; the original (was) price will be retained. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-042> |\n| REG-043 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Language & Localisation | The system will support 11 active locales across 7 storefronts: AU (/), UK (/uk/), US (/us/), US International (/en-ca/), EU domestic (/en-eu/, /fr-eu/, /it-eu/, /es-eu/), EU International (/en-ch/), ME (/en-ae/), and HK (/hk/). AU, US, ME, and HK operate in English only. EU domestic supports 4 languages (English, French, Italian, Spanish). | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-043> |\n| REG-044 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Language & Localisation | The EU storefront will support 4 languages: English, French, Italian, and Spanish. All other storefronts will serve content in English only. | Accenture | EU | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-044> |\n| REG-045 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Language & Localisation | The system will support translation of all customer-facing content across EU locale variants, including CMS content served from Contentful and product information sourced from the product API, in the applicable language for each locale. | Accenture | EU | Custom | Confirmed | @Jasmijn Tsang - CMS adaptions to support multi-language e.g. translated CTA needs button size adjusted. Worth chatting with Angelo and see how this works | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-045> |\n| REG-046 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Language & Localisation | The system will default to English as the site-wide fallback language across all storefronts where translated content is not available for the customer's selected locale | Accenture | EU | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-046> |\n| REG-047 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Language & Localisation | ~~The system will support a configurable translation pipeline for managing the end-to-end workflow between Contentful, the translation provider, and SFCC.~~ |  | EU |  | ~~Open~~ | @Tim Lavelle open discussion around transperfect and SFCC  25.05: De-scoped. Translation will occur between Contentful/Transperfect. Any translations via SFCC will be done via jSON files? | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-047> |\n| REG-048 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Consent Management - Didomi | The system will present a cookie consent banner on first visit for all storefronts, managed by Didomi CMP. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-048> |\n| REG-049 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Consent Management - Didomi | The system will only load third-party tracking and marketing scripts after the customer has granted consent via Didomi. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-049> |\n| REG-050 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Consent Management - Didomi | The system will persist customer cookie consent preferences across sessions. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-050> |\n| REG-051 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Consent Management - Didomi | The system will present customers with the following configurable cookie consent categories via Didomi: Performance Cookies, Analytics Cookies, and Marketing Cookies. Required Cookies are non-configurable. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-051> |\n| REG-052 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Consent Management - Didomi | The system will allow customers to review and update their cookie consent preferences at any time via the storefront | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-052> |\n| REG-053 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Consent Management - Didomi | The system will support granular consent, allowing customers to permit individual tracking categories independently | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-053> |\n| REG-054 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Consent Management - Didomi | The system will configure Didomi consent defaults as follows: EU storefronts opted-out by default; customers who take no action are treated as opted-out. AU, US International, HK, and ME storefronts opted-in by default; customers who take no action are treated as opted-in. The US domestic storefront will require an explicit customer choice with no default; customers who take no action are treated as opted-out. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-055><https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-054> |\n| REG-055 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Consent Management - Didomi | The system will ensure GTM and Didomi are correctly integrated within the SFCC PWA Kit to support Google Consent Mode v2 signal passing across all storefronts. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-055> |\n| REG-056 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Consent Management - Didomi | The system will pass hashed first-party customer data (email address) to GTM at the point of order confirmation to support Enhanced Conversions tracking. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-056> |\n| REG-057 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Consent Management - Marketing | The system will display a marketing opt-in checkbox at two points: on the guest checkout entry page and on the account registration page. The checkbox will be unchecked by default for all storefronts except US, where it will be pre-checked. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-057> |\n| REG-058 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Consent Management - Marketing | The system will pass the marketing opt-in preference to Omneo on order placement for guest customers, and at the point of account registration for registered customers. Omneo will sync the preference to Emarsys. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-058> |\n| REG-059 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Consent Management - Marketing | The system will allow registered customers to update their marketing communication preferences via My Account. Updates will sync to Omneo. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-059> |\n| REG-060 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Data Privacy & Compliance | The system will support deletion of customer PII from SFCC in response to a right-to-erasure request, including registered customer accounts, saved addresses, and guest order data. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-060> |\n| REG-061 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Data Privacy & Compliance | The system will support management of right-to-erasure and DSAR requests via the SFCC GDPR cartridge, replacing the current manual legal and IT ticketing process. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-061> |\n| REG-062 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Data Privacy & Compliance | The system will allow data retention periods to be configured in SFCC Business Manager per market. Customer PII will be automatically purged upon expiry of the configured retention period. | Accenture | ALL | Config | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-062> |\n| REG-063 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Data Privacy & Compliance | The system will coordinate deletion of Adyen payment tokens held in SFCC as part of the right-to-erasure process. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-063> |\n| REG-064 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Data Privacy & Compliance | The system will display a localised privacy policy per storefront, accurate for the legal requirements of each market. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-064> |\n| REG-065 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Data Privacy & Compliance | The system will support export of all customer PII held in SFCC in response to a DSAR, in a portable and readable format. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-065> |\n| REG-066 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Data Privacy & Compliance | The system will maintain a consent audit log, recording when and how consent was captured, to support GDPR compliance and regulatory audit requirements. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-066> |\n| REG-067 | Regional Storefronts, Multi-Language, GDPR & Consent | Data Privacy & Compliance | The system will provide the ability to report on customers impacted by a data breach, filterable by country and US state, to support multi-jurisdiction breach notification obligations. | Accenture | ALL | Custom | Confirmed |  | <https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/issues/?jql=project%20%3D%20%22SFCC%22%20AND%20labels%3DREG-067> |",
